1	//! Core types for the routines system.
2	//!
3	//! A routine is a named, persistent, user-owned task with a trigger and an action.
4	//! Each routine fires independently when its trigger condition is met, with only
5	//! that routine's prompt and context sent to the LLM.
6	//!
7	//! ```text
8	//! ┌──────────┐     ┌─────────┐     ┌──────────────────┐
9	//! │  Trigger  │────▶│ Engine  │────▶│  Execution Mode  │
10	//! │ cron/event│     │guardrail│     │lightweight│full_job│
11	//! │ system    │     │ check   │     └──────────────────┘
12	//! │ manual    │     └─────────┘              │
13	//! └──────────┘                               ▼
14	//!                                     ┌──────────────┐
15	//!                                     │  Notify user │
16	//!                                     │  if needed   │
17	//!                                     └──────────────┘
18	//! ```
19	
